// Fostral's height map bent into a torus: the axial direction wraps, so the
// world has no ends. The derived length (~503 m) gives a centreline radius
// of ~80 m — comfortably above radius.end, so the tube doesn't self-intersect.
(
    radius: (start: 10.0, end: 15.0),
    density: 10.0,
    shape: Torus,
)
